{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04428","headline":"答韩使同在边 · 陈子昂","name":"答韩使同在边","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉家失中策，胡马屡南驱。\n闻诏安边使，曾是故人谟。\n废书怅怀古，负劒许良图。\n出关岁方晏，乘障日多虞。\n虏入白登道，烽交紫塞途。\n连兵屯北地，清野备东胡。\n边城方晏闭，斥堠始昭苏。\n复闻韩长孺，辛苦事匈奴。\n雨雪颜容改，纵横才位孤。\n空怀老臣策，未获赵军租。\n但蒙魏侯重，不受谤书诬。\n当取金人祭，还歌凯入都。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04428.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04428","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}